xm=[0,bdC],kxc=a91,kxd=bfg,kxe=a96,kxf=bdl,kxg=bdC,kwI=[0,ij],kxa="src/haz3lcore/derived/ResidentProgram.re.Summary.item_summary",kxA="src/haz3lcore/derived/ResidentProgram.re.Summary.t",kxF=[0,0,0],kxI=[0,m],kxJ=[0,ij],kxL=[0,"- **checkbox** \xe2\x80\x94 Toggle UI for boolean literals."],kxM=[0,"- **slider** \xe2\x80\x94 Numeric literal editor (integer)."],kxN=[0,"- **sliderf** \xe2\x80\x94 Numeric literal editor (floating-point)."],kxO=[0,"- **card** \xe2\x80\x94 **Playing-card** editor: a tuple `(Suit, Rank)` such as `(Hearts, Ace)` or a list of those tuples. **Not** for records, modules, or `{ let \xe2\x80\xa6; \xe2\x80\xa6 }` blocks."],kxP=[0,"- **livelit** \xe2\x80\x94 Custom livelit projector for structured literal editing."],kxQ=[0,"- **text** \xe2\x80\x94 Multiline string literal editor."],kxR=[0,"- **table** \xe2\x80\x94 Spreadsheet-style editor for a **list of labeled tuples** sharing the same labels; the labels become column headers. Attaches off the **elaborated** form, so it can apply where the surface syntax alone is not yet a table."],kxS=[0,"- **csv** \xe2\x80\x94 CSV **file import** UI. Attaches only when the definition is the **empty list** `[]`; after placement, import fills it with row/tuple syntax. Non-empty lists (e.g. `[1, 2, 3]`) **cannot** take this projector."],kxT=[0,0,0],kxU=[0,m,[0,"These are alternative UIs for literals and structured values that may already appear in code.",0]],kxV=[0,"### Livelits (menu projectors)",0],kxX=[0,m,0],kxY=[0,m,[0,"### Syntax projector tools (Filbert)",[0,"`place_syntax_projector(kind, paths)`, `remove_syntax_projector(paths)`, and `toggle_syntax_projector(kind, paths)` apply **syntax projector** UIs to the term selected by each path.",[0,"`kind` must be a menu projector name (`fold`, `slider`, `sliderf`, `check`, `text`, `card`, `csv`, `table`, `livelit`) \xe2\x80\x94 not `probe` or `statics` (those use the probe/statics tools).",[0,m,[0,"**CRITICAL \xe2\x80\x94 livelits are not automatic:** Ordinary Hazel code (`let speed = 50`, `let is_active = true`, list literals, records) renders as **plain text** until you call **`place_syntax_projector`**.",[0,'If the user asks how livelits work, or wants sliders/checkboxes/CSV editors/text boxes, you **must** call `place_syntax_projector` with the right `kind` on each binding path (e.g. `slider` on `"speed"`, `check` on `"is_active"`, `text` on `"message"`, `csv` only when the RHS is `[]`, `card` only on playing-card tuples/lists\xe2\x80\x94see livelit lines above; nested paths like `"config/volume"`).',[0,"**Never** describe interactive widgets as present based only on `insert_*`, `update_*`, or other edit tools \xe2\x80\x94 that is false unless the matching `place_syntax_projector` calls succeeded.",[0,m,0]]]]]]]]],kxZ=kC(["## Projectors and the agent view",m,"### Fold (`\xe2\x8b\xb1`)","A **fold** is a collapsed definition in the GUI: the definition shows as `\xe2\x8b\xb1` (not source text).","Use `expand` / `collapse` (see **Paths** and **View Tools** above).",m,"### Runtime probe refractor","The **probe** refractor attaches to a binding and shows evaluated values in the agent view (e.g. `expr \xe2\x89\xa1 value`).","Tools: `place_probe`, `remove_probe`, `toggle_probe`.",m,"### Statics refractor (type overlay)","The **statics** refractor shows a type ascription overlay in the GUI (offside type cell) for human clarity.","It does not change program text; the agent\xe2\x80\x99s printed context may not mirror the overlay unless printing is extended.",m]),kx1=[0,"**Projectors**: **Folds** display as `\xe2\x8b\xb1` (collapsed defs; expand/collapse in the full prompt).",[0,"**Refractors** overlay bindings: **probes** show runtime values (`\xe2\x89\xa1` in context); **statics** add a type overlay in the GUI.",[0,"**Livelits** are alternate UIs for literals (checkbox, slider/sliderf, text, card, csv, table, livelit, plus fold in the menu).",[0,"**Agent tools**: `place_syntax_projector` / `remove_syntax_projector` / `toggle_syntax_projector` (see full prompt).",[0,"Full detail lives in Filbert\xe2\x80\x99s live system prompt **Projectors and the agent view** section (this excerpt may be truncated).",0]]]]],kx6="Editor.Meta.t_of_yojson",kx5="Editor.Meta.yojson_of_t",kx4="Editor.Meta.t_of_sexp",kx2="Editor.Meta.sexp_of_t",kyb=[0,0,[0,1,[0,2,[0,3,0]]]],kya=[0,0,[0,1,[0,2,[0,3,0]]]],kyc=[0,0,[0,1,[0,2,[0,3,0]]]],kx$=[0,"Empty hole"],kx_=hB,kx9=[0,"Missing operator"],kx7=[0,0,1],kx8=[0,0,0],kyd=[0,[0,li,[0,V,[0,[0,ca,[0,g,jR]],[0,[0,ky,[0,V,[0,[0,lr,[0,V,[0,pzh,pzg]]],0]]],[0,[0,h3,[0,h,[0,[0,g,lr],0]]],0]]]]],0],kye=dZ,kyf=[0,cn,[0,g,bi$]],kyg=eQ,kyh=[0,ca,[0,g,eQ]],kyi=[0,[0,li,[0,V,[0,[0,ca,[0,g,jR]],[0,[0,ky,[0,V,[0,[0,lr,[0,V,[0,pzj,pzi]]],0]]],[0,[0,h3,[0,h,[0,[0,g,lr],0]]],0]]]]],0],kyj=dZ,kyk=[0,cn,[0,g,bgz]],kyl=eQ,kym=[0,ca,[0,g,eQ]],kyn=[0,[0,li,[0,V,[0,[0,ca,[0,g,jR]],[0,[0,ky,[0,V,[0,[0,lr,[0,V,[0,pzl,pzk]]],0]]],[0,[0,h3,[0,h,[0,[0,g,lr],0]]],0]]]]],0],kyo=dZ,kyp=[0,cn,[0,g,beO]],kyq=eQ,kyr=[0,ca,[0,g,eQ]],kyH=[0,1],kyE=[0,Kx],kyF=[0,F],kyG=cj,kyC=[0,40],kyB=[0,k3],kyD=m,kyA=[0,0],kyv=[0,1],kyw=[0,m],kyx=[0,ij],kyy=F,kyz=cj,kys=bYy,kyt=dxZ,kyu=aNJ,kyI=[0,0],kyK=[0,fa,[0,pL,[0,d2,0]]],kyS=[0,0],kyT=[0,0],kyQ=[0,0],kyR=[0,0],kyP=[0,2],kyO=[0,1],kyN=[0,0],ky4=[0,0,0],ky1=[0,0,0],ky2=[0,[0,0,0],[0,1,0]],ky3=[0,1],kyY=[0,wv,[0,xB,0]],kyZ=[0,kU,[0,lt,0]],ky0=[0,dp,[0,aG,0]],kyX=[0,0],kyW=[0,0],kyV=[0,0],kyU=[0,[0,mj,[0,n4,0]],0],kzc="no note",kzd="mod-root wrap did not yield a single module body",kze="root sort is not fast-parseable (Exp and Mod only)",ky8=[0,i4],ky9=[0,is],ky_=is,kza=[0,aG],ky$=dp,kzb=aG,ky7="segment expects a hole but source tokens are exhausted",ky6="Haz3lcore.FastParse.Mismatch",kzr=[0,1],kzs=[0,1],kzl=[0,"empty clipboard"],kzq=[0,"caret is inside a token"],kzp=[0,"backpack is nonempty"],kzo=[0,"caret sort is not Exp"],kzn=[0,"clipboard delimiters unbalanced"],kzm=[0,"clipboard would merge with a token at the caret boundary"],kzi=xB,kzj=lt,kzk=aG,kzh=[0,1],kzg=[0,1],